With the Query Editor

To retrieve the records with the query editor, you must first define an index.

Define an Index

Before you can retrieve your records with the query editor, you must first define an index in your bucket.
The index helps your cluster find specific data when you run a query.

To define an index:

In the navigation breadcrumbs in the Capella UI, do 1 of the following:

